#[=======================================================================[.rst:
RBLXBuildGraphVizOptions
--------------------

.. note::

  This module is not intended to be included in RBLXBuild projects directly.
  It once contained the information for using Graphviz in RBLXBuild.  For
  Graphviz usage in RBLXBuild refer to the :option:`rblxbuild --graphviz`.
#]=======================================================================]
